  Copyright (c) 2023 Raffaele Cappelli. MIT License.
  LEADER (Lightweight End-to-end Attention-gated Dual autoencodER) minutiae extractor.

  `leader/leader_torch.py` is a PyTorch port of the original Keras LEADER model, verified to
  reproduce its outputs to ~1e-6. `leader/weights/leader_weights.npz` and `leader_layers.json`
  are the original LEADER architecture/weights (dumped from the MIT-licensed package).
  `leader/weights/leader_universal_deploy.pt` is a derivative fine-tuned from those weights.

  The original LEADER code and weights remain under their MIT License; that license and copyright
  notice are retained here as required. Fine-tuned weights are derivative works distributed under
  this project's Apache-2.0 license. The datasets used for fine-tuning are not included.

Benchmark comparisons reported in RESULTS.md additionally cite FingerNet and MinutiaeNet
(© 2017 Dinh-Luan Nguyen, MIT) for context; no code or weights from those projects are
included in this repository.
